 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bqbscDEb_0gQ7kNvwE6HQ-J&_nc_oc=AdqROLjtve0ZDkgnY4KVyc3yiCduWmTv42YCZgtvOFR6_Bo4Huedderu3ekT5dImdRc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJpuyfJnmINyBQiEMgesI0_bke0Kgi7C_5llS1GOaLrgQ&oe=6AB933C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rXaLL-zFp8wQ7kNvwGIxCHE&_nc_oc=AdqeDvjF5BVUDL_CcAkM26hwwiTcnlYHINzzhQh3mDvhxSo8D9fMiA1LSnI9Nz2MFrM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKLyT35skspJkQY8oLDXy4syLOgw4GEr6PFtj3PFr07Pw&oe=6AB908E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T7xTGszljKsQ7kNvwFnIaPZ&_nc_oc=AdpmyG-8EaIz09QOpTo1Vsb3iU9wkeQgSzuL1W-0D3e2UDlJn4hfxvBXbSU-ALV6XH8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKfIGjRFX1e-4DTTAEAz6zhgAWpi0yO97VexaBboa2N3A&oe=6AB912DC"}, {"fil